OL,3,AEd Sheeran admits 'mistakes' as he
OL,4,Aaddresses Macklemore controversy at
OL,5,APhiladelphia show
OL,6,
OL,7,FEd Sheeran has apologised to fans for
OL,8,Fmaking "mistakes", as he opened a solo
OL,9,Fshow in Philadelphia by addressing the
OL,10,Fcontroversy that has engulfed his tour.
OL,12,FThe star responded to the fallout over
OL,13,Frapper Macklemore being dropped from
OL,14,Fthe tour for making pro-Palestinian
OL,15,Fremarks on stage earlier in September.
OL,17,F"I never wanted to be an activist
OL,18,Fmusician, but this has put me in the
OL,19,Fmiddle of an important and passionate
OL,20,Fargument about free speech and the most
OL,21,Fcomplex political issue on the planet,"
OL,22,Fhe said at Saturday's show.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
