OL,3,AEd Sheeran admits 'mistakes' as he
OL,4,Aaddresses Macklemore controversy at
OL,5,APhiladelphia show
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe described the 7 October 2023
OL,8,FHamas-led attacks as "horrific" and
OL,9,Fcalled the situation in Gaza
OL,10,F"unjustifiable" in his first in-person
OL,11,Fremarks since the controversy began.
